$DATUM Synthesis of Optically Active Picolinates 9−12.
(E)-4,8-Dimethylnona-3,7-dien-2-one. According to the Grignard addition
to aldehyde 19, aldehyde 20 (466.5 mg, 3.06 mmol) in THF (30 mL) was
subjected to reaction with MeMgBr (4.60 mL, 0.99 M in THF, 4.55 mmol) at
rt for 1 h to furnish racemic alcohol rac-24 Colorless oil, (467.1 mg,
91%).
