$DATUM (Z)-4,8-Dimethylnona-3,7-dien-2-one. According to the Grignard addition
to aldehyde 19, aldehyde 22 (520.0 mg, 3.42 mmol) in THF (25 mL) was
subjected to reaction with MeMgBr (5.18 mL, 0.99 M in THF, 5.13 mmol) at
rt for 2 h to produce racemic alcohol rac-26 Colorless oil, (492.0 mg,
86%).
