$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Preparation of (E)-1-Phenyl-1,5-hexadien-3-ol (1t)3 Following the
Representative Procedure, cinnamaldehyde (132 mg, 1.0 mmol), RuCl3•xH2O
(6.2 mg, 0.03 mmol, 0.03 equiv), allyl acetate (130 μL, 1.2 mmol, 1.2
equiv), H2O (27 μL, 1.5 mmol, 1.5 equiv), Et3N (14 μL, 0.1 mmol, 0.1
equiv), hexamethylbenzene (16 mg, 0.1 mmol, internal standard for NMR
analysis) and dioxane (2.5 mL) were combined under 30 psi of CO at 70 °C
for 24 h. Workup and purification by silica gel column chromatography
eluting with hexanes/MTBE (4:1, 100 mL; 3:1, 200 mL) provided 1t (137 mg,
79%) as a colorless oil. (E)-1-Phenyl-1,5-hexadien-3-ol (1t)3, yield 137
mg, 79%. Data for 1t: 1H NMR (400 MHz, CDCl3) 7.42-7.39 (m, 2 H, Aryl),
7.35-7.32 (m, 2 H, Aryl), 7.28-7.25 (m, 1 H, Aryl), 6.63 (d, J = 15.8, 1
H, HC(1)), 6.27 (dd, J = 15.8, 6.4, 1 H, HC(2)), 5.80 (dddd, J = 18.1,
10.2, 7.5, 6.9, 1 H, HC(5)), 5.23-5.18 (m, 2 H, H2C(6)), 4.39 (tdd, J =
6.0, 6.4, 4.0, 1 H, HC(3)), 2.48-2.37 (m, 2 H, H2C(4)), 1.93 (d, J = 4.0,
1 H, OH) 13C NMR (125 MHz, CDCl3) 136.6 (C(1')), 134.0 (C(5)), 131.5
(C(2)), 130.3 (C(1)), 128.5 (C(3') & C(5')), 127.6 (C(4')), 126.4 (C(3')
& C((5')), 118.4 (C(6)), 71.6 (C(3)), 41.9 (C(4)) IR (NaCl) 3367 (m),
3077 (m), 3025 (m), 2904 (m), 1640 (m), 1599 (w), 1493 (m), 1448 (m),
1126 (m), 1029 (m), 966 (s) HRMS (CI) Calcd. for C12H15O, 175.1123;
found, 175.1122 TLC Rf 0.48 (hexanes/ethyl acetate, 3:1) [UV, CAM]
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
