$DATUM Triaconta-4E,15Z,26E-triene-1,29-diyne-3,28-diol (4). To a solution of
ethynylmagnesium bromide (2.88 mL, 1.44 mmol, 0.5 M in THF) at 0 °C under
nitrogen was added, dropwise, the dialdehyde 3 (202 mg, 0.52 mmol) in THF
(4 mL). The reaction progress was monitored by TLC. At the completion of
the starting material the reaction mixture was quenched using saturated
NH4Cl solution and the organic layer was extracted using EtOAc. The
combined organic layers were neutralized using aq NaHCO3 and dried over
MgSO4. Purification was effected via column chromatography to afford 4 as
a pale yellow solid (196 mg, 86%): mp 36-37 °C; IR 1461, 2146, 2850,
2919, 2999, 3288 cm-1;1H NMR(300 MHz, CDCl3) δ1.24-1.39 (m, 28 H),
1.92-2.07 (m, 8 H), 2.54 (d, J = 2.1 Hz, 2 H), 4.82 (t, J = 5.9 Hz, 2 H),
5.36 (m, 2 H), 5.59 (dd, J = 15.3, 6.5 Hz, 2 H), 5.89 (dt, J = 15.3, 6.6
Hz, 2 H); 13C NMR (75 MHz, CDCl3) δ 28.8, 29.15, 29.18, 29.4, 29.5, 29.6,
29.7, 31.9, 32.6, 62.8, 73.9, 83.4, 128.4, 130.4, 134.6; HRMS calcd for
C30H48O2 (M + Na) 463.3552, found 463.3547.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
