$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General Procedure D: Allylboration of
Aldehydes and Ketones using Binaphthol-modified Allylboronates. To a
solution of triallylborane (0.75 mmol, 1.5 eq) in dry THF (4 mL) under
argon was added the 3,3'-disubstituted BINOL 4 (0.9 mmol, 1.8 eq). This
mixture was stirred at room temperature for 2 h and then was heated at
reflux for 1 h. The solution was cooled to -78 °C (in ketone cases, THF
